  "correct": "3",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\n**Logic: First Number ÷ 1000 = Second number**\n\n**⇒ 10.3 : 0.0103**\n\n⇒ 10.3 ÷ 1000 = 0.0103\n\n⇒ **0.0103 = 0.0103**\n\nSimilarly,\n\n**1) 2.80 : 0.0280 →**\n\n⇒ 2.80 ÷ 1000 = 0.0028\n\n⇒ **0.0028 **≠ **0.0280**\n\n**2) 020 : 0.002 →**\n\n⇒ 020 ÷ 1000 = 0.02\n\n⇒ **0.02 ≠ 0.002**\n\n**3) 2.80 : 0.00280 →**\n\n⇒ **2.80 ÷ 1000 = 0.0028**\n\n⇒ **0.0028 = 0.00280**\n\n**4) 020 : 0.20 →**\n\n⇒ 020 ÷ 1000 = 0.02\n\n⇒ **0.02 ≠ 0.20**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"Option (3)\".**",
